    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I Hate Seagulls&quot; is a chaotic third-person flying game where you play as a seagull on a mission to be the worst seagull imaginable. Soar through the skies, snatch sandwiches, scream at strangers, and rain down poop from above. Your goal? Fly fast, steal everything, and leave a glorious trail of mayhem.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/a7e98af46ecf89bbd407832179f4ac10.poster.avif?t=1745411897\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/a7e98af46ecf89bbd407832179f4ac10.webm?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/a7e98af46ecf89bbd407832179f4ac10.mp4?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Live the ultimate seagull life. Enjoy hot dogs!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/2ce2e543427c3151b686244c50f25880.poster.avif?t=1745411897\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/2ce2e543427c3151b686244c50f25880.webm?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/2ce2e543427c3151b686244c50f25880.mp4?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not all Seagulls are friends. make friends or steal from rivals.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/b5cd30bbdb590f23743c5341cdc9aa68.poster.avif?t=1745411897\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/b5cd30bbdb590f23743c5341cdc9aa68.webm?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/b5cd30bbdb590f23743c5341cdc9aa68.mp4?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the environment to take down your rivals.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/fe2e909d9603dd927f9517b25174d179.poster.avif?t=1745411897\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/fe2e909d9603dd927f9517b25174d179.webm?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/fe2e909d9603dd927f9517b25174d179.mp4?t=1745411897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather your flock and strike as one! <br> </p>",
